ew-image buttonBase-GK1x3M"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L"><polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"></polyline><polyline points="9 21 3 21 3 15"></polyline><line x1="21" x2="14" y1="3" y2="10"></line><line x1="3" x2="10" y1="21" y2="14"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class="image-caption">Elodie Malois (Left), Me (Middle), Alexandra Fangeat (Right)</figcaption></figure></div><p>Going into the race day with some fatigue, I wasn&#8217;t expecting much, but I ended up getting a new PB in the 3km IP and snagging the gold medal!</p><h3>NCIM Race Nights &#8211; Milton, ON</h3><p>The weekly NCIM Race Nights were perfect for experimenting with positioning, attacks, and sprint timing in a fast paced environment. These nights helped me build consistency and confidence going into the next month of training and racing!</p><div class="captioned-image-container"><figure><a class="image-link image2 is-viewable-img" target="_blank" href="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!fmhM!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4331d370-32a6-4678-86c7-3fe95b0c9cbb_4032x3024.jpeg" data-component-name="Image2ToDOM"><div class="image2-inset"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!fmhM!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4331d370-32a6-4678-86c7-3fe95b0c9cbb_4032x3024.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!fmhM!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4331d370-32a6-4678-86c7-3fe95b0c9cbb_4032x3024.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!fmhM!,w_1272,c_limit,f_