.com/image/fetch/$s_!fmhM!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4331d370-32a6-4678-86c7-3fe95b0c9cbb_4032x3024.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!fmhM!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4331d370-32a6-4678-86c7-3fe95b0c9cbb_4032x3024.jpeg 1456w" sizes="100vw" loading="lazy"></picture><div class="image-link-expand"><div class="pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset"><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="var(--color-fg-primary)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon-noB79L"><g><path d="M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L"><polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"></polyline><polyline points="9 21 3 21 3 15"></polyline><line x1="21" x2="14" y1="3" y2="10"></line><line x1="3" x2="10" y1="21" y2="14"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class="image-caption">Pre-Race skills and drills with coaches Jenny Trew and David Jack</figcaption></figure></div><div><hr></div><h3>February - Milton, ON</h3><h3>Cycling Canada Development Camp &#8211; Milton, ON: 2nd - 6th</h3><p>February started with an amazing Cycling Canada Development Camp. I was training with top riders from all around Canada heading to the Pan American Championships, while learning from Cycling Canada coaches, improving my technical skills, recovery, and track strategy. It was a big step forward in my development as a rider and I appreciate all those who let me attend.</p><h3>Ontario Cup #3 &#8211; Milton, ON: 7th</h3><p>Back on the track, Ontario Cup #3 was another intense weekend. Applying what I learned at the development camp, I focused on sprint timing and endurance, and it was exciting to see progress in my racing. I set a new PB in the Kilo, along with a 2nd in the Tempo and 1st in the Points!</p><div class="captioned-image-container"><figure><a class="image-link image2 is-viewable-img" target="_blank" href="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!9QZ4!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1b90ed5f-33bd-4187-b17e-71e679155d06_5712x4284.jpeg" data-component-name="Image2ToDOM"><div class="image2-inset"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!9QZ4!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1b90ed5f-33bd-4187-b17e-71e679155d06_5712x4284.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!9QZ4!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1b90ed5f-33bd-4187-b17e-71e679155d06_5712x4284.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!9QZ4!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1b90ed5f-33bd-4187-b17e-71e679155d06_5712x4284.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/