<![CDATA[ <p><strong>Hello Everyone,</strong></p><p>I&#8217;m back with an exciting update from the biggest track racing experience of my year: the <strong>UCI Junior Track World Championships in Apeldoorn, Netherlands</strong>, this experience was a dream come true. I couldn&#8217;t have done it without the amazing support from my GoFundMe contributors and personal sponsors:</p><div class="captioned-image-container"><figure><a class="image-link image2 is-viewable-img" target="_blank" href="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!BHEy!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0cee8e19-dd83-4014-a2d0-5aae6274952b_1452x556.png" data-component-name="Image2ToDOM"><div class="image2-inset"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!BHEy!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0cee8e19-dd83-4014-a2d0-5aae6274952b_1452x556.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!BHEy!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0cee8e19-dd83-4014-a2d0-5aae6274952b_1452x556.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!BHEy!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0cee8e19-dd83-4014-a2d0-5aae6274952b_1452x556.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!BHEy!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0cee8e19-dd83-4014-a2d0-5aae6274952b_1452x556.png 1456w" sizes="100vw"><img src="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!BHEy!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0cee8e19-dd83-4014-a2d0-5aae6274952b_1452x556.png" width="1452" height="556" data-att