3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L"><polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"></polyline><polyline points="9 21 3 21 3 15"></polyline><line x1="21" x2="14" y1="3" y2="10"></line><line x1="3" x2="10" y1="21" y2="14"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class="image-caption">The girls gearing up for Round 1 of Team Pursuit! From left to right, Raphaelle Houde, Alexandra Fangeat, ME, Elodie Malois</figcaption></figure></div><p>Racing in Apeldoorn was intense and, honestly, a bit humbling. I finished <strong>13th in the Individual Pursuit</strong> and <strong>5th in the Team Pursuit</strong> with my teammates Alexandra Fangeat, Raphaelle Houde, Elodie Malois, and Teagan Gawne. Unfortunately, I crashed during the elimination race, which was tough in the moment, but the experience gave me valuable lessons about resilience, focus, and staying calm under pressure. Overcoming the crash helped me grow as an athlete and a person.</p><div class="captioned-image-container"><figure><a class="image-link image2 is-viewable-img" target="_blank" href="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!WDyk!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9f94df2f-8875-4450-b2fe-233c489351ef_2048x1367.jpeg" data-component-name="Image2ToDOM"><div class="image2-inset"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!WDyk!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9f94df2f-8875-4450-b2fe-233c489351ef_2048x1367.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!WDyk!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9f94df2f-8875-4450-b2fe-233c489351ef_2048x1367.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!WDyk!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9f94df2f-8875-4450-b2fe-233c489351ef_2048x1367.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!WDyk!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9f94df2f-8875-4450-b2fe-233c489351ef_2048x1367.jpeg 1456w" sizes="100vw"><img src="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!WDyk!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9f94df2f-8875-4450-b2fe-233c489351ef_2048x1367.jpeg" width="1456" height="972" data-attrs="{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/9f94df2f-8875-4450-b2fe-233c489351ef_2048x1367.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:972,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:216299,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://evetbuczkowski.substack.com/i/174058436?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9f94df2f-8875-4450-b2fe-233c489351ef_2048x1367.jpeg&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}" class="sizing-normal" alt="" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!WDyk!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9f94df2f-8875-4450-b2fe-233c489351ef_2048x1367.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!WDyk!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9f94df2f-8875-4450-b2fe-233c489351ef_2048x1367.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!WDyk!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9f94df2f-8875-4450-b2fe-233c489351ef_2048x1367.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!WDyk!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9f94df2f-8875-4450-b2fe-233c489351ef_2048x1367.jpeg 1456w" sizes="100vw" loading="lazy"></picture><div class="image-link-expand"><div class="pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset"><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="var(--color-fg-primary)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon-noB79L"><g><path d="M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L"><polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"></polyline><polyline points="9 21 3 21 3 15"></polyline><line x1="21" x2="14" y1="3" y2="10"></line><line x1="3" x2="10" y1="21" y2="14"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class="image-caption">My crash in the elimination</figcaption></figure></div><p class="button-wrapper" data-attrs="{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://youtu.be/LxBiwwgj94o?t=9393&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Watch me crash!&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}" data-component-name="ButtonCreateButton"><a class="button primary" href="https://youtu.be/LxBiwwgj94o?t=9393"><span>Watch me crash!</span></a></p><div><hr></div><h3>Training Camp - August 6-16th - Bromont, QC</h3><p>Beyond the results, the World Championships were a chance to experience the atmosphere of top-level international competition. The training camp helped me dial in my technique, and the support from Team Canada made everything smoother, from recovery to bike prep. Sharing this journey with fellow athletes, learning from their strategies, and racing on the world stage was truly unforgettable.</p><div class="captioned-image-container"><figure><a class="image-link image2 is-viewable-img" target="_blank" href="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!_IJi!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb95f650d-4376-4ec8-9534-477be91e8ba8_1264x948.jpeg" data-component-name="Image2ToDOM"><div class="image2-inset"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!_IJi!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb95f650d-4376-4ec8-9534-477be91e8ba8_1264x948.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!_IJi!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb95f650d-4376-4ec8-9534-477be91e8ba8_1264x948.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!_IJi!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb95f650d-4376-4ec8-9534-477be91e8ba8_1264x948.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!_IJi!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb95f650d-4376-4ec8-9534-477be91e8ba8_1264x948.jpeg 1456w" sizes="100vw"><img src="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!_IJi!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb95f650d-4376-4ec8-9534-477be91e8ba8_1264x948.jpeg" width="542" height="406.5" data-attrs="{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/b95f650d-4376-4ec8-9534-477be91e8ba8_1264x948.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:948,&quot;width&quot;:1264,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:542,&quot;bytes&quot;:702965,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://evetbuczkowski.substack.com/i/174058436?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb95f650d-4376-4ec8-9534-477be91e8ba8_1264x948.jpeg&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}" class="sizing-normal" alt="" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!_IJi!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb95f650d-4376-4ec8-9534-477be91e8ba8_1264x948.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!_IJi!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb95f650d-4376-4ec8-9534-477be91e8ba8_1264x948.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!_IJi!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb95f650d-4376-4ec8-9534-477be91e8ba8_1264x948.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!_IJi!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb95f650d-4376-4ec8-9534-477be91e8ba8_1264x948.jpeg 1456w" sizes="100vw" loading="lazy"></picture><div class="image-link-expand"><div class="pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset"><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="var(--color-fg-primary)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon-noB79L"><g><path d="M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L"><polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"></polyline><polyline points="9 21 3 21 3 15"></polyline><line x1="21" x2="14" y1="3" y2="10"></line><line x1="3" x2="10" y1="21" y2="14"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class="image-caption">Team Pursuit qualifying at the World Championships</figcaption></figure></div><p>I want to thank everyone again who contributed to my GoFundMe and for those who have supported my journey, you helped me make this trip possible. Every pedal stroke, every race, and every learning moment in Apeldoorn was because of your generosity and belief in me. The experience has inspired me to keep pushing, learning, and chasing new goals on the track.</p><p>Here&#8217;s to more racing, growth, and exciting challenges ahead!</p><div><hr></div><h3>Forest City Velodrome Memorial</h3><p>This year also marks a bittersweet moment for our track community. After 20 incredible years of operation, the Forest City Velodrome (FCV) will be closing its doors this winter. FCV was the starting point for me and five other athletes who went on to compete at Junior Track Worlds this year, and it has also produced numerous other elite riders over its lifetime, including Olympic athletes, world champions, and national-level competitors such as Nick Wammes, Cole Dempster, Tyler Rorke, Ruby West, and Ethan Powell. It has been an incredible foundation for so many young riders.</p><div class="captioned-image-container"><figure><a class="image-link image2 is-viewable-img" target="_blank" href="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MI2u!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd87f9b09-b0e6-4782-8ce0-6c2efb98da82_4032x3024.jpeg" data-component-name="Image2ToDOM"><div class="image2-inset"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MI2u!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd87f9b09-b0e6-4782-8ce0-6c2efb98da82_4032x3024.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MI2u!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd87f9b09-b0e6-4782-8ce0-6c2efb98da82_4032x3024.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MI2u!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd87f9b09-b0e6-4782-8ce0-6c2efb98da82_4032x3024.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MI2u!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd87f9b09-b0e6-4782-8ce0-6c2efb98da82_4032x3024.jpeg 1456w" sizes="100vw"><img src="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MI2u!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd87f9b09-b0e6-4782-8ce0-6c2efb98da82_4032x3024.jpeg" width="486" height="647.8887362637363" data-attrs="{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/d87f9b09-b0e6-4782-8ce0-6c2efb98da82_4032x3024.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:1941,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:486,&quot;bytes&quot;:2455289,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://evetbuczkowski.substack.com/i/174058436?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd87f9b09-b0e6-4782-8ce0-6c2efb98da82_4032x3024.jpeg&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}" class="sizing-normal" alt="" title="" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MI2u!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd87f9b09-b0e6-4782-8ce0-6c2efb98da82_4032x3024.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MI2u!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd87f9b09-b0e6-4782-8ce0-6c2efb98da82_4032x3024.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MI2u!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd87f9b09-b0e6-4782-8ce0-6c2efb98da82_4032x3024.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MI2u!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd87f9b09-b0e6-4782-8ce0-6c2efb98da82_4032x3024.jpeg 1456w" sizes="100vw" loading="lazy"></picture><div class="image-link-expand"><div class="pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset"><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="var(--color-fg-primary)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon-noB79L"><g><path d="M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L"><polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"></polyline><polyline points="9 21 3 21 3 15"></polyline><line x1="21" x2="14" y1="3" y2="10"></line><line x1="3" x2="10" y1="21" y2="14"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class="image-caption">My mom and I at the Forest City Velodrome during its operation</figcaption></figure></div><p>I want to give a special thank you to <strong>Ron and Dick</strong>, who supported me unconditionally, they were the biggest support group for my journey and helped shape my love for the sport. To all the other volunteers and coaches at FCV, your dedication has made a huge impact, and it&#8217;s deeply disappointing to see the velodrome close. I hope the legacy of FCV inspires future programs, because many young athletes may never get the chance to experience track cycling in the same way.</p><div><hr></div><h3>Next Up!</h3><p>The season doesn&#8217;t stop here! I&#8217;m already gearing up for some exciting races and training blocks this winter and spring:</p><ul><li><p><strong>UCI C2 Track Racing &#8211; January - Bromont, QC</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>Elite Track Nationals &#8211; January - Bromont, QC</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>Arizona Training Camp &#8211; February - Phoenix, AZ</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>Track Provincials &#8211; March - Milton, ON</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>Track Nationals &#8211; April - Milton, ON</strong></p></li></ul><p>I can&#8217;t wait to keep building on everything I learned at Worlds and continue improving as a rider. Each race and training block is another step toward bigger goals, and I&#8217;m ready to give it my all.</p><p><strong>Your support means the world, so thank you for being part of this journey.</strong></p><p>Eve</p><div><hr></div><div class="subscription-widget-wrap-editor" data-attrs="{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://evetbuczkowski.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe&quot;,&quot;language&quot;:&quot;en&quot;}" data-component-name="SubscribeWidgetToDOM"><div class="subscription-widget show-subscribe"><div class="preamble"><p class="cta-caption">Thanks for reading Chasing the Break: My Journey in Cycling! Subscribe for free to receive new posts and support my work.</p></div><form class="subscription-widget-subscribe"><input type="email" class="email-input" name="email" placeholder="Type your email&#8230;" tabindex="-1"><input type="submit" class="button primary" value="Subscribe"><div class="fake-input-wrapper"><div class="fake-input"></div><div class="fake-button"></div></div></form></div></div> ]]>
