iv></a><figcaption class="image-caption">Elly Moore (left - 2nd), Oda Aune Gissinger (centre - 1st), ME (right - 3rd)</figcaption></figure></div><p>It was such a cool experience to be part of the first ever women&#8217;s Abitibi, and I&#8217;m really proud to have been a part of that moment. Racing with Team Canada at a UCI race was a dream, and I learned a ton from it. </p><div class="captioned-image-container"><figure><a class="image-link image2 is-viewable-img" target="_blank" href="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mOQO!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2ba831ba-03d7-4e1c-98bf-3ebf97ed8b12_4451x3338.jpeg" data-component-name="Image2ToDOM"><div class="image2-inset"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mOQO!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2ba831ba-03d7-4e1c-98bf-3ebf97ed8b12_4451x3338.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mOQO!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2ba831ba-03d7-4e1c-98bf-3ebf97ed8b12_4451x3338.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mOQO!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2ba831ba-03d7-4e1c-98bf-3ebf97ed8b12_4451x3338.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mOQO!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2ba831ba-03d7-4e1c-98bf-3ebf97ed8b12_4451x3338.jpeg 1456w" sizes="100vw"><img src="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mOQO!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2ba831ba-03d7-4e1c-98bf-3ebf97ed8b12_4451x3338.jpeg" width="718" height="538.5" 