lass="sizing-normal" alt="" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!adTi!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7c76110c-e508-4f7a-a0d4-22022e062e6c_1767x2356.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!adTi!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7c76110c-e508-4f7a-a0d4-22022e062e6c_1767x2356.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!adTi!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7c76110c-e508-4f7a-a0d4-22022e062e6c_1767x2356.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!adTi!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7c76110c-e508-4f7a-a0d4-22022e062e6c_1767x2356.jpeg 1456w" sizes="100vw" loading="lazy"></picture><div class="image-link-expand"><div class="pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset"><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="var(--color-fg-primary)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon-noB79L"><g><path d="M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L"><polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"></polyline><polyline points="9 21 3 21 3 15"></polyline><line x1="21" x2="14" y1="3" y2="10"></line><line x1="3" x2="10" y1="21" y2="14"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><h5>Left &#8594; Right</h5><h5>Dylan Baker, Serena Grodski, Taylor Tompkins, Eve Buczkowski, Larissa Pedersen</h5><div class="native-video-embed" data-component-name="VideoPlaceholder" data-attrs="{&quot;mediaUploadId&quot;:&quot;a3239d76-2e81-4cb0-a095-a1fbf66dc2cc&quot;,&quot;duration&quot;:null}"></div><div><hr></div><h3>Your Contributions</h3><p>I truly appreciate the incredible support I&#8217;ve received so far this year. Here&#8217;s a breakdown of some of the key cycling related expenses from April, these are just a few examples of where your contributions are directly making an impact:</p><ul><li><p><strong>Ontario Cup #1 &#8211; Bradford, ON</strong> &#8594; $85.50 (race registration and race-day supplies)</p></li><li><p><strong>Track Worlds Preparation</strong> &#8594; $550.00 + food <em>(early preparation fees)</em></p></li></ul><p><strong>Total: $635.50</strong> <em>(excluding food, travel, and accommodations)</em></p><p>Your partnership helps cover these essential costs and allows me to stay focused on training and performance, without having to worry about the growing expenses that come with high-performance racing. Every dollar makes a difference, thank you for being a part of this journey.</p><div><hr></div><h3>Upcoming Events</h3><p>The next few months are full of exciting races and opportunities, and I&#8217;m training hard to be ready. Here&#8217;s what&#8217;s coming up:</p><ul><li><p><strong>Charlevoix Stage Race</strong> &#8211; May 28 &#8594; June 3, 2025 &#8211; Charlevoix, QC</p></li><li><p><strong>Canadian Road Nationals</strong> &#8211; June 24 &#8594; June 30, 2025 &#8211; Beauce, QC</p></li><li><p><strong>Tour de l'Abitibi F&#233;minin</strong> &#8211; July 11 &#8594; July 14, 2025 &#8211; Val-d&#8217;Or, QC</p></li><li><p><strong>Chicago Grit</strong> &#8211; July 18 &#8594; July 27, 2025 &#8211; Chicago, IL</p></li><li><p><strong>Track Worlds Preparation Camp</strong> - August 6 &#8594; August 16, 2025 - Bromont, QC</p></li></ul><p>Thank you again for supporting me th</p><p>rough another incredible month. I&#8217;m excited for what&#8217;s ahead and so grateful to have you in my corner.</p><div class="subscription-widget-wrap-editor" data-attrs="{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://evetbuczkowski.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe&quot;,&quot;language&quot;:&quot;en&quot;}" data-component-name="SubscribeWidgetToDOM"><div class="subscription-widget show-subscribe"><div class="preamble"><p class="cta-caption">Thanks for reading Chasing the Break: My Journey in Cycling! Subscribe for free to receive new posts and support my work.</p></div><form class="subscription-widget-subscribe"><input type="email" class="email-input" name="email" placeholder="Type your email&#8230;" tabindex="-1"><input type="submit" class="button primary" value="Subscribe"><div class="fake-input-wrapper"><div class="fake-input"></div><div class="fake-button"></div></div></form></div></div> ]]>
